for MIN of `TIP_DETAIL.ISBN` directly (per column-mapping hint), not material attributes.\n- **SUBJECT_OFFERED / SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY / SUBJECT_SUMMARY / LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED** — alternative offering fact tables (registrar section grain, subject grain, final-enrollment summary, library-reserve scope). All carry enrollment measures but none carries ISBN; the question's measures (ISBN + NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS + offering dept/school) all live in the TIP family.\n- **STUDENT_DEPARTMENT / SIS_SUBJECT_CODE** — lighter department lookup and subject-code lookup; STUDENT_DEPARTMENT lacks `IS_DEGREE_GRANTING` (per concept_department_dimension comparison), so it cannot support the degree-granting filter.\n\n**Metrics (precedents):** dw_1165 (exact-phrase precedent, full SQL retrieved), dw_1350 (range/variance/avg of NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS per degree-granting department from TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED, full SQL retrieved), dw_3356, dw_4527, dw_4640, dw_2958, dw_4812, dw_4650, dw_3727, dw_4231, dw_3668, dw_4602 (variance/avg enrollment or TIP-material patterns on the same tables).\n\n**Concepts:** concept_subject_offering_facts, concept_course_material_programs, concept_department_dimension (full details retrieved).\n\n**Column concepts:** column_concept_enrollment_measures, column_concept_department_name, column_concept_subject_id, column_concept_material_status_key, column_concept_term_code (full details retrieved for the first three).\n\n## 2. Lineage & Relationships\n\nFrom `semantic_graph` on TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED: joins → SIS_DEPARTMENT, STUDENT_DEPARTMENT, ACADEMIC_TERMS(_ALL), COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED; incoming joins from TIP_DETAIL, LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED, SUBJECT_OFFERED, SIS_SUBJECT_CODE, LIBRARY_RESERVE_MATRL_DETAIL. Concept memberships: concept_subject_offering_facts, concept_course_material_programs. Column concepts: term_code, subject_id, department_name, enrollment_measures, master_subject_id.\n\nDocumented join keys (matching the task hints exactly):\n- SIS_DEPARTMENT.DEPARTMENT_CODE ↔ TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED.OFFER_DEPT_CODE (column defs of both tables)\n- SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION.DEPARTMENT ↔ SIS_DEPARTMENT.DEPARTMENT_CODE (SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION.DEPARTMENT column def)\n- TIP_DETAIL.SUBJECT_ID ↔ TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED.SUBJECT_ID (TIP_DETAIL.SUBJECT_ID column def)\n\nPrecedent lineage: dw_1165's Subquery2 uses exactly TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED ⋈ SIS_DEPARTMENT ⋈ SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION with `IS_DEGREE_GRANTING='Y'` and `COURSE_LEVEL='G'`. dw_1350 uses TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED ⋈ SIS_DEPARTMENT with `MAX-MIN` range and `VARIANCE()`.\n\n## 3. Similar-Entity Differences\n\n**3a. Dimension matrix (enrollment/ISBN source candidates):**\n\n| Dimension | TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED | SUBJECT_OFFERED(_SUMMARY) | SUBJECT_SUMMARY | LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Granularity | subject/term, TIP scope | section / subject grain | subject/cluster, final stats | subject/term, library scope |\n| Enrollment col | NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS | NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS + SUBJECT_ENROLLMENT_NUMBER | SUBJECT_ENROLLMENT_NUMBER | NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS |\n| ISBN available | via child TIP_DETAIL.ISBN | none | none | none (library ISBN is in LIBRARY_RESERVE_CATALOG) |\n| Offering dept/school cols | OFFER_DEPT_NAME / OFFER_SCHOOL_NAME | OFFER_DEPT_* | DEPARTMENT_* / SCHOOL_* | OFFER_DEPT_* |\n| Degree-granting filter | via SIS_DEPARTMENT join | via SIS_DEPARTMENT join | via SIS_DEPARTMENT join | via SIS_DEPARTMENT join |\n\n(Evidence: concept_subject_offering_facts comparisons; column_concept_enrollment_measures; table column defs.)\n\n**3b. Task-Requirement Fitness:**\n- Measure `NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS` (hint-mapped): TIP_SUBJECT_OFFERED SUPPORTED; SUBJECT_SUMMARY NOT-SUPPORTED (has SUBJECT_ENROLLMENT_NUMBER only).\n- `ISBN` (hint-mapped to TIP_DETAIL.ISBN): TIP_DETAIL SUPPORTED; LIBRARY_RESERVE_CATALOG has ISBN but is not in gold tables and belongs to the library domain.\n- `IS_DEGREE_GRANTING` filter: SIS_DEPARTMENT SUPPORTED; STUDENT_DEPARTMENT NOT-SUPPORTED (no